            "review_text": "Wallace_B4\nHong Kong, China6 contributions\n0\nContinued declines in quality and service\nDec 2017 • Friends\nWhen I first visited three years ago, the food was alright and staff attentive. I don't know what happened since then but it seems like everything is gone way downhill. You can tell there is something very wrong because staff just have no motivation and the food is of minimal quality. Its like their only real goal is to take your money and that's it...what a fraud@!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 12, 2018",
