            "review_text": "ScambusterSZ\nSydney, Australia1748 contributions\n0\nOK Local fast Food with free loud music\nOct 2017 • Friends\nThis is a chain set up with several outlets. The food is fine serving tradition local Vietnamese food at good prices but not a comfortable venue.\n\nThe chairs are too big for the tables and screech when moved and they insist on playing loud annoying music at 9am to the point you cant have a discussion. \n\nWake up people, and think about your customers. Won't return.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 30, 2017",
